four: the Chan Linux package manager.

Named after the four leaves of the clover. It manages packages as files
in a repository and tracks installed state on disk.

  four list              show available packages
  four installed         show installed packages
  four install <pkg>     install a package
  four remove <pkg>      remove an installed package
  four info <pkg>        show a package's contents
  four help              this help

four is written in x86-64 assembly, like all of Chan's userland.
